        "created_at": "2016-01-17T02:22:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ronway, you are right. In hero selection, you are just given the choice of \"The Sentinels\" and \"The Adamant Sentinels\". But, if you remove them as you would a non character hero target, you can add in either version of each character.<br><br><br>Although a LIMITLESS amount. I have 5 Mainstays right now, and 1 Adamant Mainstay.</p>",
